# .NET build output.
#
# Note what is NOT here: server/src/**/Persistence/Migrations. Migrations are
# source. They are the only record of how the schema got from one shape to the
# next, and a schema rebuilt from the model instead of replayed from migrations
# loses every data transformation along the way.
server/**/bin/
server/**/obj/
server/.vs/
server/**/*.user

# Playwright capture output — regenerated by scripts/, never reviewed as source
shots*/
verify/
spot/
routes/
ref/

# Hero video.
#
# A1.mp4 is 584MB and A3.mp4 is 493MB — both far past GitHub's 100MB hard
# limit per file, so they cannot be committed to a normal repository at all.
# The hero degrades correctly without them: PhotoField layers the video over
# the still and only reveals it once it can play, so with no file present the
# photograph simply stays. Drop the mp4s back into public/vid/ locally and the
# motion returns with no code change.
public/vid/*.mp4
